# Tokens that enter attacking were never declared as attackers (CR 508.4), so "whenever a creature you control attacks"
# does not trigger for them. Bot1 has Shared Animosity (a creature that attacks gets +1/+0 for each other attacking creature)
# and attacks with the lone Ornithopter (no bonus); sneaking in The Last Ronin's Technique adds three tokens that are not
# pumped: they deal 3, not more (Bot2 at 17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Shared Animosity
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
The Last Ronin's Technique
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Shared Animosity.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Hand.The Last Ronin's Technique.Cast(Ability: Sneak)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
